Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(196,42.667)\i1}You just complain, without ever coming up with\Nany practical suggestion."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari, you're really leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But I already know where I'll go next.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(200,38.4)\i1}What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(200,38.4)\i1}Are you saying we should even create clones \Nto increase the birth rate?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever heard of... Kagami Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1}♪Well, that's my bad♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.05,0:00:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1}♪An incarnation that's fallen out of place♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i0}♪Don't leave me behind♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.63,0:00:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1}♪My bad♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\b1\pos(193.6,283.733)}♪I know it's all my fault♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1}♪Why can't I forget only \Nthe things I want to {\b1\i1}forget?♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.33,0:00:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,♪{\b1\i1}My bad♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.83,0:00:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,♪{\b1\i1}Well, that's my bad♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.55,0:00:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(188.8,176)\b1\i1\fs20}"Chapter 2 - Investigation"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Misbehave, and the Double will come out of the\NForbidden Place to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.07,0:01:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I got permission to leave the Colony...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To investigate Kagami Village and the rumors\Nabout the Double.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew, I'm spent. \NMy back is killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.47,0:01:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But the air's so clean out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.85,0:01:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's the Colony's air being too\Npolluted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't get autumn leaves \Nthis pretty back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(200,22.4)\i1}"Sorry to interrupt your rambling monologue."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(196,19.2)\i0}"Is this your car?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What a rude android.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.76,0:01:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you last get updated?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.95,0:01:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(191.2,21.333)}"Is it your car?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.83,0:01:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(191.2,19.2)}"{\i1}Show me your license."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.78,0:01:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.21,0:01:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry. \NI need to check in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.33,0:01:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(189.6,21.333)}"Just show me your license."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.40,0:01:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My license...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.48,0:01:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? No, I'm sure I have it...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.71,0:01:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(185.6,22.4)}"{\i1}Please follow us to the station."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I really have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1}"Letter of Apology"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.13,0:02:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(185.6,22.4)}"{\i1}Write more neatly."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your stupid letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.25,0:02:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(200.8,21.333)}"{\i1}A person went missing yesterday."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.58,0:02:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(202.4,24.533)}"{\i1}There were reports of a strange car nearby."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.96,0:02:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I just arrived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.09,0:02:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, that's not my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.22,0:02:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard she went to the hospital yesterday,\Nright?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.91,0:02:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.41,0:02:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Do you believe in the Double?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.08,0:02:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, tell me more about what your \Nsister you were saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.95,0:02:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,C-C'mon...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.37,0:02:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just ignoring me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm a detective, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.10,0:02:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the police won't listen to you, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.53,0:03:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So your sister hasn't come back from the\Nhospital? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the wom... girl I spoke to at the\Nfestival, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.04,0:03:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Last weekend's autumn festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.89,0:03:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm good with faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.78,0:03:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Must've been someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.84,0:03:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember your question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.42,0:03:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"{\i1}If this plushie mattered a lot to you... If you\Ndidn't want to lose it..."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"{\i1}What would you do?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.23,0:03:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhm, are you talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And you said... you'd buy a spare one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.67,0:03:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.31,0:03:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd just put a GPS tag on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Mari.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.31,0:03:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I drove here from a faraway Colony to\Ninvestigate something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.62,0:03:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A Colony? \NThe capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. Just a tiny one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(178.4,34.133)}"{\b1\i1\fs20}Chinese Restaurant Kagami"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been to that autumn festival...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.22,0:03:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But I did want to ask you about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.95,0:04:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You mentioned the Double...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.91,0:04:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Double took my sister's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.23,0:04:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.63,0:04:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.71,0:04:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(189.6,21.333)}"{\i1}Next stop, Higure Inn... Higure Inn..."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.80,0:04:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.09,0:04:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it. \NShe told me on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.35,0:04:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.85,0:04:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister. The real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.21,0:04:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can still contact her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She promised to meet me again tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.07,0:04:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,By a huge transmission tower near my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why she can keep in contact but won't\Ncome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Something felt off during yesterday's call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.25,0:04:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane, did you come to visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.15,0:04:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Nah, just passing by!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.87,0:04:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandma manages this inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.73,0:04:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I happen to be sta... Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.97,0:04:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to check in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I keep forgetting stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.31,0:05:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, when you're meeting \Nyour sister tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind if I come along?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.56,0:05:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, or I'll leave you behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.00,0:05:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get scolded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.57,0:05:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I just love the scenery from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just some boring sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.18,0:05:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act like it's the Forbidden Place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The inn's sign keeps us hidden. \NNobody can see us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.23,0:05:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And the third transmission tower \Nisn't in use anymore anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.10,0:05:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane-chan ...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:06:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,From today, this place will be our secret base.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.76,0:06:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa... So this is high-voltage transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Controlling arc discharges with just gas\Npressure and pilot lamps is a crazy idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not burning out even \Nat three megavolts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.57,0:06:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sister didn't show up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go home. \NYour parents will be worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.18,0:06:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.43,0:07:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was alone there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... Look, if that's fine by you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.39,0:07:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you search for her tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.39,0:07:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.49,0:07:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A transit pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret base that only you and I know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.47,0:07:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Exciting, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.57,0:07:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish it wasn't so high up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.61,0:07:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's promise not to tell anyone about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.35,0:07:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"Secret base"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, we just found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.50,0:08:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in a really dangerous place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane knows so much stuff, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She's like a grown up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.72,0:08:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you in a bad mood or something today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you talk about our secret base?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.94,0:08:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.38,0:08:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well... Just a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.34,0:08:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But I didn't say where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.50,0:08:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sis...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.90,0:08:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-This...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.46,0:08:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Was supposed to be our secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.40,0:08:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The third transmission tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. It's not in use anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought maybe I could find out \Nsomething about Sis there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Let's try going there, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, eat up, Akanecchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:09:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Akanecchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.23,0:09:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't remember names if I don't turn \Nthem into nicknames.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want a different one?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.60,0:09:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we can't count on the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll look for your real sister ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I'll take care of the bill here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.80,0:09:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There, Mari. I paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You should probably stop wallowing \Nand start looking for your wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.93,0:09:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm used to losing my wallet anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.14,0:09:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just have a cigarette or whatever and cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? But I don't smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.80,0:09:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.56,0:09:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.04,0:09:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That charm on your wallet looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But... Only my sister and I have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.68,0:09:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was buying some canned coffee yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.90,0:10:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And I noticed one just like yours on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe my sister lost it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... There was a red bridge, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A red bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.26,0:10:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.68,0:10:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.25,0:10:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the road to the Forbidden Place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.11,0:10:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I said we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But why? \NMaybe we'll find some new clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called the Forbidden Place for a reason.\NWe'll go to the transmission tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.45,0:10:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh. I want to go to the Forbidden Place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.89,0:10:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's the transmission tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Forbidden Place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.65,0:10:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Transmission tower
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.79,0:10:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Forbidden Place!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.53,0:10:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Transmission tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.32,0:10:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(200.8,22.4)}"{\b1\i1}Kagami Park - Third Transmission Tower"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.80,0:10:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Awww, why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.19,0:10:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have to climb? \NTowers look more impressive from below!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.23,0:10:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mari.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.83,0:10:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like there weren't any clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:11:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry back down then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.88,0:11:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wait below!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.09,0:11:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did my sister go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.15,0:11:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.26,0:11:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Akanecchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Was your sister the only one \Nwho used that secret base?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.21,0:11:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.24,0:11:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I did. But let's go home for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.54,0:11:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.63,0:11:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1\pos(180,64)}Last Will
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. I shouldn't get involved any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.36,0:11:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to go to the Forbidden Place \Nand see for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(204.8,36.267)}"{\i1}That concludes the message from the new\NDirector."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.58,0:11:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(191.2,25.6)}"{\i1}I'm sorry."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:12:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. \NThere's nothing you could've done, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.55,0:12:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pack up and move out next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.46,0:12:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(189.6,26.667)}"{\i1}Mari, don't you think this is weird?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(184.8,44.8)}"{\i1}As soon as research on clones starts picking up\Nsteam, the director changes and you get sacked."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it just a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(175.2,29.867)}"{\i1}I have a bad feeling about this."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the two of us were supposed \Nto know of our secret base.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sis, you're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.53,0:12:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything were to happen to me, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.15,0:12:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? \NYour illness...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But the doctors said that you're fine now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.94,0:12:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad aren't in Kagami anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure they'll come back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.90,0:12:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you be all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.99,0:13:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're lucky. It's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.79,0:13:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my sister's transit pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But what is it doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,People from Kagami always \Nsteer clear of this area...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.49,0:13:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.27,0:13:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This leads to the Forbidden Place's \Nsouthern gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Southern gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.26,0:13:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. It's the gate closest to the village. \NAnd it's off limits, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what happens \Nif you enter the Forbidden Place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Something scary. \NAbsolutely terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the Double takes \Nyour place or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.49,0:13:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I just know it's supposed to be scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, they don't look it, \Nbut the police are good at finding people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.11,0:13:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And if they still can't find your sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:13:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Akanecchi...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.47,0:13:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.58,0:14:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I haven't even said anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.99,0:14:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You were going to suggest we go \Nto the Forbidden Place, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.67,0:14:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Akanecchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What if your sister was waiting for you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What if she was starving to death there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What if she was just \Nplaying hide and seek there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.34,0:14:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No means no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.37,0:14:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you were lying when you said \Nyou were a detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I wasn't lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.60,0:14:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of detective loses her license, \Ngets picked up by the police...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,then loses her wallet and needs a kid to pay for\Nher lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hng...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1}ERROR. ERROR.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.25,0:14:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1}THANK YOU.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm used to dealing with this kind of stuff.\NFrom work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.41,0:14:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you said, I'm not a detective. \NI used to be a researcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.41,0:14:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And why did you come to Kagami Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.61,0:14:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just some grown-up stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.80,0:14:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's go back to that bridge \Nwhere I found your sister's charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.61,0:15:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Do I need to explain this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.43,0:15:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The southern gate is shut so tight \Nnobody could even get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.36,0:15:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Akanecchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.96,0:15:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to make a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A d-deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, at the tower, \NI picked up an envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.14,0:15:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,An envelope? From my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me! Show me! Show...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.94,0:15:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In return...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.93,0:15:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me how to get into the Forbidden Place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.17,0:15:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Higure women have always been in charge of\Nthe maple pyre.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And of managing the Forbidden Place's gates as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.35,0:15:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Managing them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In short, we hold onto the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if you used those keys \Nto open the southern gate...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't do. You saw it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.91,0:15:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You really can't go through there. \NAnd it's in a residential district, so somebody could see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another gate few know of: \Nthe northern gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Where's the northern gate's key?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.02,0:16:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Mari.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.32,0:16:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. \NGrandma isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.14,0:16:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get the cops on my case again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.79,0:16:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is Sis's Health Monitoring Android Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.14,0:16:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"Health Monitoring"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a surveillance quadru...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.81,0:16:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mari.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma's closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.62,0:16:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Somewhere around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(185.6,282.667)}So she must have left the village...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad. She came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Akanecchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.21,0:16:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(184,23.467)}"{\i1}Oh, it's a dog."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(186.4,22.4)}"{\i1}Yeah, good boy."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(170.4,23.467)}"{\i1}Come on, you try too."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:17:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I risked getting arrested there...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, I can get into the \NForbidden Place, with this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The key to the northern gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This road is in shambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.09,0:17:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But according to the map, we should be close...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.00,0:17:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody lives around here. \NPhones get no reception either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.65,0:17:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's those stairs there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.11,0:17:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope we'll find some clue \Nabout your sister there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.94,0:17:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be the northern gate entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.10,0:17:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Gate? Looks more like a whole building.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.88,0:17:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Mari. \NOpen the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your family manages it, right? \NYou open it, Akanecchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just in charge of the keys, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.46,0:17:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, whatever. \NLet's open it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.84,0:17:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.09,0:17:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of joke is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.37,0:18:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea. \NI'd never been there before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The northern gate only led to an empty room...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we didn't make any progress \Nin finding your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But the sun's starting to set. \NWe should go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.55,0:18:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they even found her already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.93,0:18:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.11,0:18:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.75,0:18:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.65,0:18:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.74,0:18:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The engine won't start!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to wait until tomorrow, \Nthen walk to somewhere with reception...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you cold, Akanecchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This time your parents will \Nget worried for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.01,0:18:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.38,0:19:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My parents left for the city years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.73,0:19:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,For work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.18,0:19:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And Grandma's busy with the inn. \NNobody will notice I'm missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.86,0:19:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sister must mean the world to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari... do you think I'll ever see her again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.79,0:19:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That whole thing about the Double can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.77,0:19:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She must've had some reason to make it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.80,0:19:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari. Show me the envelope you found \Nat the third transmission tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.72,0:19:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'll have to show you eventually...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.71,0:19:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't think now's the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.56,0:19:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's... a will, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,H-How do you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.32,0:19:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister didn't go to the hospital to get cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:19:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She couldn't talk anymore. \NShe couldn't breathe by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.48,0:19:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She needed a machine to make her heart beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.32,0:20:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a loud sound, \Nand then a black car took her away...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.13,0:20:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mari... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.06,0:20:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I think my sister died that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.18,0:20:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I can't remember my childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The research lab took me into their orphanage,\Nand that's why I started working there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The population in our Colony was going down, \Nand clone research got funding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.43,0:20:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was helping with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw the city change shape around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.99,0:20:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shops closing, buildings rotting away.\NEverything deserted, except for the city's center.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.12,0:21:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We were trying to help our city however we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.63,0:21:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But last year, I was taken off the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.85,0:21:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.06,0:21:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But it made me angry. \NAnd I decided I had to get back at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.83,0:21:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to catch Kagami's Double and make huge\Nadvancements in clone research, all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.95,0:21:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.15,0:21:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost believed you for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.26,0:21:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's sleep now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.81,0:21:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That will I found was just an empty envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.13,0:21:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It was probably some kind of prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.74,0:21:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.62,0:21:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.89,0:21:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Stop! \NThis isn't right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.22,0:22:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
